{"id":"vod_lz_7618","vodId":"7618","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"学园孤岛","name_cn":"学园孤岛","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220415-1/02de3297626e7d37a35a41c65cbf4256.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在巡之丘学园中，丈枪由纪（水濑祈 配音）天真可爱，是名副其实的开心果。惠飞须泽胡桃（小泽亚李 配音）踏实可靠，她的坚强和元气影响了身边的每一个人。若狭悠里（市道真央 配音）温柔坚强，是大家心目中稳重的靠山。直树美纪（高桥李依 配音）外表冷漠，但内心的热情不容忽视。这些可爱的孩子们共同组成了“学园生活部”，每天都在进行愉快的部活。                                                                     　　空无一人的校园，破败不堪的教室，四处游走的行尸，究竟哪一个是幻想，哪一个是真实？巨大的灾难面前，少女们将恐惧化作力量，尽各自的所能，目的只有一个，那就是活得更久，更快乐。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-04-15 16:05:47","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220415/8062_38b8beb4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220415/8064_d9c4ffa4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220415/8063_79597e93/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220415/8066_81679e56/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220415/8065_15da3402/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220415/8067_4c5801c0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220415/8068_8f02e28e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220415/8069_0cc3dde6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220415/8070_1216cb25/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220415/8071_87483f6d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220415/8072_9ad9d4f6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220415/8073_d6e5290f/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:12.408Z"}